NOT rebuilt here -- the SNP scan is imputed from the smoothed haplotype
rds, so a new scan makes it stale. Resubmit it separately (no --sex: the
chrX dosage is already in the Num it reads from the rds):
  bash scripts_oneoffs/AGE_SY/nov_only/run_snp_scans.sh

then: git add temp_aging/numbers/ temp_aging/peak_table.txt && git commit && git push
